# Check-ins: what you get when you key the radio with nothing ringing. The runtime picks
# one that fits the day and hasn't been used today; the last one is the fallback.

call CI_QUIET
  day 1-3
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Is it always this quiet?
DOT  Quieter, usually. You're new. The mountain's still deciding about you.

call CI_DOING
  day 1-11
  time 09:00-18:00
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. What are you doing right now?
DOT  Crossword. Seven letters, "patient listener." Don't you dare say it.

call CI_KETTLE
  day 2-11
  time 05:00-11:00
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. The kettle's stuck again.
DOT  Left side, Kestrel. Hit it on the left. Firmly. Like you mean it.

call CI_SLEEP
  day 1-11
  time 22:00-29:00
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Can't sleep.
DOT  Count the stairs. Forty-eight. Nobody's ever made it to the top.

call CI_RIDGE
  day 1-11
  where area:ridge
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Calling from the ridge.
DOT  Show-off. Is it as good as he said?
THEO Better.
DOT  Don't tell me. I'll be jealous for a week.

call CI_TARN
  day 1-11
  where area:tarn
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. I'm at the tarn. It's very still.
DOT  Don't fall in. I'm not driving up there to fish you out.

call CI_BURN
  day 1-11
  where area:burn
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. I'm in the burn.
DOT  Ninety-eight. I was on this desk. I heard Augie call that one in. His voice did a thing I'd never heard before or since.

call CI_TWINS
  day 3-11
  time 05:00-12:00
  needs fawn_names
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Sharp and Flat say good morning.
DOT  Tell them Basin says good morning back. Tell them to stay off the road.

call CI_PEACH
  day 3-6
  needs supply_today
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. I ate a peach. Cold. You were right.
DOT  I'm always right. It's a curse.

call CI_SOUND
  day 4-11
  needs sound_logged
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. I've got a sound for you.
DOT  Go on, then.
THEO The wind in the snags. Like a bow on a cello string nobody's holding.
DOT  ...That's a good one. Write it down.

call CI_FIRE
  day 5-6
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. How's Harrow?
DOT  Hungry. It'll keep. The crew's good. Go and look at something that isn't burning.

call CI_TIRED
  day 6-7
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Get some sleep.
DOT  Says the man calling me to tell me. ...Copy. Soon.

call CI_HAZE
  day 7
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. The haze is getting in my eyes.
DOT  Shut the windows. Sit. You're good at that now.

call CI_ELK
  day 8-11
  needs elk_done
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. The big one's bugling again. Down by the creek.
DOT  He's showing off for you. Don't encourage him.

call CI_AFTER
  day 9-11
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. What will you do? After?
DOT  Same as everybody. Find out. Ask me in October.

call CI_COLD
  day 9-11
  time 05:00-10:00
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. My breath's showing in the cab.
DOT  Light the stove. Augie used to read me the thermometer every hour like it was a ball game.

call CI_RAIN
  day 11
  needs rain_on
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. It's raining.
DOT  I know, Kestrel. I can hear it on your roof. Stay in it as long as you like.

call CI_GENERIC
  day 1-11
  kind checkin
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Just checking in.
DOT  Copy, Kestrel. All quiet down here. Go and look at something pretty.
